@startuml
title Archive or restore a team
skinparam shadowing false
start
:Administrator selects a team;
if (Season in Registration?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Reject;
  stop
endif
if (Action?) then (archive)
  :Set archived flag and record actor and time;
else (restore archived team)
  if (Registration window permits restore?) then (yes)
    if (Roster player on another active team\nin same sport and season?) then (yes)
      :Reject with player and team details;
      stop
    else (no)
      :Clear archive flag and archive metadata;
    endif
  else (no)
    :Reject restore;
    stop
  endif
endif
:Commit and refresh teams and available-player data;
stop
legend bottom
  Archive is allowed throughout Registration.
  Restore also requires an open registration date window.
  Roster additions and archive/restore share a season-sport lock.
endlegend
@enduml
